{"id": "good_15", "label": 1, "note": "Inconsistent formatting: Missing trailing period '.' at end of descriptive sentence (unlike other entries)\n", "path": "testdata/baselines/reference/tsc/commandLine/Parse-watch-interval-option.js", "from_line": 86, "to_line": 86, "lang": "Go", "category": "Maintainability and Readability", "context_level": "Diff Level", "is_ai_comment": true, "source_model": "Qwen-Coder-480B", "pr_url": "https://github.com/microsoft/typescript-go/pull/698", "commit": "100dbc5127e723c4108efc02a179d9aec5fce32a", "code": "46\t  tsc -b\n47\t  Build a composite project in the working directory.\n48\t\n49\t  tsc --init\n50\t  Creates a tsconfig.json with the recommended settings in the working directory.\n51\t\n52\t  tsc -p ./path/to/tsconfig.json\n53\t  Compiles the TypeScript project located at the specified path.\n54\t\n55\t  tsc --help --all\n56\t  An expanded version of this information, showing all possible compiler options\n57\t\n58\t  tsc --noEmit\n59\t  tsc --target esnext\n60\t  Compiles the current project, with additional settings.\n61\t\n62\tCOMMAND LINE FLAGS\n63\t\n64\t--all\n65\tShow all compiler options.\n66\t\n67\t--version, -v\n68\tPrint the compiler's version.\n69\t\n70\t--init\n71\tInitializes a TypeScript project and creates a tsconfig.json file.\n72\t\n73\t--project, -p\n74\tCompile the project given the path to its configuration file, or to a folder with a 'tsconfig.json'.\n75\t\n76\t--showConfig\n77\tPrint the final configuration instead of building.\n78\t\n79\t--help, -h\n80\tPrint this message.\n81\t\n82\t--watch, -w\n83\tWatch input files.\n84\t\n85\t--build, -b\n86\tBuild one or more projects and their dependencies, if out of date\n87\t\n88\tCOMMON COMPILER OPTIONS\n89\t\n90\t--target, -t\n91\tSet the JavaScript language version for emitted JavaScript and include compatible library declarations.\n92\tone of: es5, es6/es2015, es2016, es2017, es2018, es2019, es2020, es2021, es2022, es2023, esnext\n93\tdefault: es5\n94\t\n95